{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>East of Asshur.</b> The tav in place of heh, so it is as though written קדמה, and the heh in place of lamed at the beginning, like 'to the east of Asshur.'" "<b>It is the Perat.</b> Known to Israel, for it is the boundary of the land of Israel, as it is written: 'until the great river, the river Perat, shall be your border.' Therefore it writes 'it is the Perat,' and there was no need to explain further, as it explained for the other three rivers."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:02:27.735837756Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}